WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.367
-Guys, it's the end of the week.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:04.534
That's usually when I catch up
on some personal stuff.

00:00:04.534 --> 00:00:06.467
You know, I check my in-box,
I return some e-mails,

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:08.234
and of course I send out
"thank you" notes.

00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:10.901
[ Cheers and applause ]
And I was running a bit behind.

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.367
So I thought,
if you guys wouldn't mind,

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.334
I'd like to write out my weekly
"thank you" notes right now.

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:15.801
Is that cool with you guys?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.801 --> 00:00:19.267
I appreciate it.
James, can I get some

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:21.000
"thank you" note writing music,
please?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.868
[ Theme music plays ]

00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:25.567
He's in a good mood.
-Wow.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.267
He blinked.
-Hmm.

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:30.767
♪♪

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:33.968
Thank you, Chipotle,
for raising prices.

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:36.634
But if you really want
to make more money,

00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:39.234
lower your prices and
start charging for the bathroom.

00:00:39.234 --> 00:00:41.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:41.634 --> 00:00:43.501
-Nice.

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:46.334
Charging.

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:47.767
♪♪

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:51.100
-Thank you, Mike Pence's
new book, "So Help Me God,"

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:54.033
for sounding less like
the title of a memoir

00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:55.367
and more like
what your dad screams

00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:57.200
eight minutes into
every family road trip.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:02.968 --> 00:01:05.567
♪♪

00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:08.968
Thank you, climbing onto
an inflatable pool float,

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:12.133
for basically being
an aquatic sobriety test.

00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:15.367
[ Applause ]

00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:21.400
♪♪

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:24.501
Thank you,
Beyoncé's new album release.

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:27.234
[ Crowd cheers ]
I'm excited, but is it okay

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:30.300
to release something this fire
during a heat wave?

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:33.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:35.968
♪♪

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:38.100
-Fire!

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.167
-Whoo.

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:41.467
-Wow. [ Imitates explosion ]

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.367
[ Explosion ]
-Bey Hive.

00:01:43.367 --> 00:01:45.701
-Oh, behave.

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:47.100
♪♪

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:49.567
-Thank you,
watching movies in the park,

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:51.767
for being the best way
not to hear a film

00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:54.334
and hurt your back.
[ Applause ]

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.734
-[ Chuckles ]

00:01:59.734 --> 00:02:01.167
♪♪

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:03.767
Thank you, guys who wear
T-shirts in the pool,

00:02:03.767 --> 00:02:07.033
for basically saying, "I didn't
want anyone to see my body,

00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:09.400
so instead
I vacuum-sealed my torso

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.167
under one millimeter
of wet translucent fabric."

00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:13.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:13.567 --> 00:02:15.234
You see every curve.

00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:17.767
-[ Chuckles ] Oh.

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:19.734
-[ Slurps ]
-Vacuum-sealed.

00:02:19.734 --> 00:02:21.901
-[ Slurps ]
-Yeah.

00:02:24.133 --> 00:02:25.534
♪♪

00:02:25.534 --> 00:02:27.234
-Thank you, great Danes,

00:02:27.234 --> 00:02:29.934
for letting everyone know
you have a big apartment.

00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:32.701
[ Laughter and applause ]
Yeah, we get it. We get it.

00:02:32.701 --> 00:02:35.100
The dog is -- Yeah, we get it.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.934
You have a lot of space
for the dog.

00:02:37.934 --> 00:02:39.968
♪♪

00:02:39.968 --> 00:02:42.934
Thank you, billion-dollar
Mega Millions jackpot,

00:02:42.934 --> 00:02:45.467
for making everyone
just a little nervous

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:46.968
that someone they hate will win.

00:02:46.968 --> 00:02:48.968
There you have it, everybody.
Those are our "thank you" notes.

